@startuml
title C++23 CPU Datapath

component "Cpu1024" as CPU
component "CpuState" as STATE
component "opcode_memory" as IMEM
component "WideWord[16]" as REGS

CPU --> STATE : owns
CPU --> IMEM : loads program
CPU --> REGS : reads/writes 1024-bit values

note right of CPU
C++23 implementation uses std::array
and std::span for fixed-size state and
program loading.
end note

@enduml
